## 快速开始 🚀

<details open>
<summary><b>🐳 Docker 部署（推荐）</b></summary>

**Windows：**
```batch
.\docker-start.bat
```

**Linux/Mac：**
```bash
chmod +x docker-start.sh
./docker-start.sh
```

🌐 访问地址：
```text
墨枢主站   http://localhost:8012/dashboard
公开入口   http://localhost:8010/select-mode
```

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>💻 Windows 一键启动</b></summary>

```powershell
.\START_LOCAL.bat
```

访问：`http://127.0.0.1:8012/dashboard`

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>⌨️ PowerShell 手动启动</b></summary>

```powershell
.\scripts\setup-local-env.ps1 -Overwrite
.\scripts\bootstrap-shared-venv.ps1
.\scripts\start-all-local.ps1 -UseSharedVenv
```

</details>

> 🚀 **在线体验**：访问 **[colong-idea-studio.cloud](https://colong-idea-studio.cloud/)** 最快上手，无需本地配置。

